# Mount Hyjal 2 (59-60): the second half of Mount Hyjal for a Horde duo: the Wild Gods of the Cradle
# of Tranquility and Mourning's Rest, the Shrine of Aviana, the demons of Dae'gun, the Summit of
# Eternity, the last of the Barkskin furbolgs and the veteran's journey. Follows Mount Hyjal 1
# (58-60); not part of the leveling chain.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/mount_hyjal_2_59_60.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research: see Mount Hyjal 1 (58-59).
#
# Starts at the Curious Crow in the Felblood Scar, where Mount Hyjal 1 ends. Ends in Undercity
# (Orcs, Tauren, Trolls and Windshapers) or at Sen'jin Village in Durotar (Undead).
#
# Carried in from Mount Hyjal 1: Heading Up the Mountain (96931), Taking to New Heights (92171),
# Rubble Rummage (92011), Top of the Post (93269), Feathers in Flight (92609), The Western Post
# (94782), Farsight Guided (96830), Windswept Wards (93827), Barkskin Beginnings (94504). Optional
# breadcrumbs from other zones, their steps skip themselves without them: Grain of Memory (97000,
# Abigail Sawyer in Undercity), Demon Hunter's Hunter (91877, Loramus Thalipedes in Azshara) and
# Hol'anyee's Big Book of Big Lizards (92020, Hol'anyee Marshal in Un'Goro Crater).
#
# The Barkskin quests of the last visit (Herbs of the Hollow, both Water of Hyjal, Wicked Wisdom,
# Burrow Beetles, Shatter the Stonewatchers, Deeproar Down, Mystic Mix, Barkskin Breakout, Open
# Season and Burrow Bonding) come after Barkskin Beginnings: the furbolgs offer more once you are
# Neutral with them. Lifted by Legacy and its Praise are for Orcs, Tauren and Trolls (the Great Lift
# in Thousand Needles); Wake Memories and its Praise are for the Undead (Lake Everstill in the
# Redridge Mountains); the game data gives Windshapers neither, so they skip the veteran's last
# quests.
#
# The route: the Cradle of Tranquility and Mourning's Rest (Jereman, Kala'th, Marrosis, Shalla'kal,
# Galvinquam); Elderwild; Head Scratcher; the Shrine of Aviana; Dae'gun; Kaylaena and Ketharas; the
# Summit of Eternity; Ketharas, Jereman, the Barkskin Burrow, Deadwood Den and Elderwild; the
# veteran's journey out of Hyjal and back; Sen'jin Village and Undercity.

guide Mount Hyjal 2 (59-60)
